This is a practice article. It stays out of the website while its status is **Draft**. Replace this text with your own writing when you are ready.

## Begin with a question

Use this section to introduce your subject. You can add *emphasis*, **bold text**, and [links](https://www.nimrazahid.com/about).

> A clear question gives an article direction.

### Build your argument

- Introduce the question.
- Explain the evidence.
- Reflect on what it means.

1. Write a first draft.
2. Read it aloud.
3. Revise it.

